{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c1bfd02f-fc45-855c-90a5-27be5667bfda",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:53:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:50:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:50:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Excuse me, please, I am calling for my mother. She is the one who lives in the house, and I am helping her with some things. Um, I have a question about a couch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:50:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. A couch you want picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:50:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. With your permission, I would like to ask how we put it out for the trash. It is an old couch, fabric, nothing special. Can we just leave it by the street on the regular day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:50:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not just leave it, no. Bulk items like couches usually need to be scheduled ahead of time. You call it in, they give you a pickup day, and then it goes out at the curb that morning or the night before. Don't put it out early or it can get a notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:50:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Thank you. And is there a, how do you say, a limit? Only one item?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:50:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd just tell them everything you have when you schedule it, the couch and anything else big. They'll tell you what they can take."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:51:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is good. Please, one more thing. Her recycling bin, the blue one, it cracked in the storm last weekend. The nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. The wind threw it against the fence and now the bottom is broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:51:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that wind was something. Yeah, we can replace that. Is it the bin that's cracked, or did it blow away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:51:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, we have it. It is cracked, the bottom. Excuse me, how do I request a replacement? Is it a form, or I call you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:51:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can request it right here with me. I just need the address where the bin goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:51:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. Um, I prefer not to give the address on this call, if that is possible. Is there another way, maybe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:51:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. I do need the address to put the request in, otherwise they don't know where to deliver it. You could call back when you have your mother with you, or give it to me now. Either way works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:52:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand. I will call back, then, with my mother next to me. Thank you for explaining. Please, what hours are you open? I want to call at a good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:52:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're here until the end of the afternoon on weekdays. If you call tomorrow morning, it's usually quieter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:52:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Tomorrow morning. Oh, and also, it is not important, but the school is close to the house. From the yard we can hear the bell, very faintly. So I think maybe it is in your pickup area for the schools, no? I do not know if that matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:52:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It doesn't change the bulk pickup. Pickup is by address, so same process. Just have the address handy tomorrow and we'll get both the couch and the bin set up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:52:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very good. I appreciate your help. Thank you, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:53:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
